1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,290
["Love Mate" shooting set]

2
00:00:01,376 --> 00:00:02,628
Nice house, right?

3
00:00:02,753 --> 00:00:03,629
Yeah

4
00:00:03,754 --> 00:00:05,339
It's just the one
you wanted to live in

5
00:00:05,464 --> 00:00:07,549
Yes, it's a bit big
to live alone though

6
00:00:09,384 --> 00:00:11,144
It's a perfect size
for two people, isn't it?

7
00:00:16,099 --> 00:00:18,268
Tell me about
your old times

8
00:00:18,393 --> 00:00:19,393
I'm curious

9
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:22,230
Ah…

10
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:24,900
Old times…

11
00:00:25,025 --> 00:00:27,736
I don't know
where to start

12
00:00:27,861 --> 00:00:29,863
We've been friends
for ages, you know?

13
00:00:34,743 --> 00:00:35,743
Anything would be fine

14
00:00:36,995 --> 00:00:38,121
only if it's
about Hyesung

15
00:00:49,341 --> 00:00:52,928
[5 years ago]

16
00:00:55,681 --> 00:00:56,681
Hey

17
00:00:56,765 --> 00:00:58,392
why are you drinking
so much?

18
00:00:58,517 --> 00:01:00,227
Stop it

19
00:01:00,352 --> 00:01:01,937
How much did you drink?

20
00:01:02,062 --> 00:01:03,188
Hey…

21
00:01:03,313 --> 00:01:05,190
He said he liked me

22
00:01:07,025 --> 00:01:09,778
Why didn't he tell me
he was dating someone?

23
00:01:11,154 --> 00:01:12,154
Hey…

24
00:01:15,742 --> 00:01:16,742
Not again…

25
00:01:17,953 --> 00:01:19,079
Hey, let's get you home

26
00:01:19,204 --> 00:01:20,431
- Okay?
- No, I'm not going home

27
00:01:20,455 --> 00:01:21,455
You're drunk

28
00:01:21,498 --> 00:01:22,666
No…

29
00:01:22,791 --> 00:01:24,209
Stop crying!

30
00:01:24,334 --> 00:01:25,627
No, leave me alone…

31
00:01:25,752 --> 00:01:26,752
Get up

32
00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:29,380
Come on…
